- third_party/hunspell/google/bdict.cc:19-65 validates bounds, format and digest.
- components/spellcheck/renderer/spellcheck_unittest.cc:40-49 uses the same real
  pinned third_party/hunspell_dictionaries fixture directory.

Regression cases added to existing spellchecker unit-test target:
  SpellcheckHunspellDictionaryTest.InstalledDictionaryForFreshProfile
  SpellcheckHunspellDictionaryTest.UserDictionaryTakesPrecedence
  SpellcheckHunspellDictionaryTest.CorruptUserFallsBackToInstalled
