  browser_tests --gtest_filter='SpellcheckServiceBrowserTest.DeleteCorruptedBDICT'
  Real fresh-profile G24 smoke with staged dictionary and owned netlog evidence.
No build, test, lint, format, applicability check or browser execution was run
for this candidate. Input hashes/revision/size were read from the exact checkout.

